      <lb n="4" break="no"/>ku <gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="character"/> taṉ mākkālāl Amutupaṭi <g ref="sym:unclassified" type="symbol"/><note xml:lang="eng">Unidentified sign in the  transcript.</note> <g ref="sym:tam-mukkuruni"/> Itukku vēṇṭum kaṟiyamutu Uppamutu miḷakamutum neyya <gap reason="lost" quantity="12" unit="character"/>
    <lb n="5"/>cantaṉa-k kāppum Akilum Aṭaikkāyamutum Ilaiyamutum Uḷḷiṭṭa Amutupaṭi cāttupaṭikaḷum tiruppāvai kēṭṭaruḷi <gap reason="lost" quantity="6" unit="character"/>
                </p>
                <p>
    <lb n="6"/>Orunāḷaikku <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi> Amutupaṭi kala Ariciyum Itukku vēṇṭum kaṟiyamutum Uppamutum miḷakamutum neyyamutum tayiramutum <gap reason="lost" quantity="10" unit="character"/><lb
      n="7" break="no"/>kaḷum Aṭaikkāyamutum Ilaiyamutum cantirātittavarai cella-k kaṭavatāka
