            <div type="commentary">
                <p>
                    The twenty-fifth regnal year discards automatically Kulōttuṅga II. However, the title <hi rend="italic">Tribhuvanacakravartin</hi> is insufficient to distinguish with certainty whether it refers to Kulōttuṅga I (the year would be ca. 1095) or Kulōttuṅga III (which would be then ca. 1203).</p>
            </div>
            
